---
// FAQ 2 — heading on the left, six always-open answers in a two-column grid.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Good questions, plain answers</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">The things teams ask us most before they switch. No small print, no sales call required.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">Still have questions?</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">A real person on our team replies within one working day.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400 dark:hover:text-brand-300">
            <span>Talk to us</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">How long does setup take?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">About ten minutes. Create a workspace, invite your team and start from one of our templates or a blank plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">What size of team is Halcyon built for?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Teams of three to fifty get the most from it. Larger companies usually run one workspace per department.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">Do clients and freelancers need a seat?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">No. Guests can view and comment on the projects you share with them for free, and you only pay for full members.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">Which tools does it connect to?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Slack, Google Calendar, GitHub and Figma work out of the box. Everything else is reachable through our open API and webhooks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">Is there a mobile app?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Yes, for iOS and Android. Both work offline and sync quietly the moment you are back in range.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-line pt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-fg">Do you offer discounts?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Nonprofits, schools and open-source projects get half off every plan. Annual billing saves a further two months.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
